          "message": {
            "text": "The bundle copies the final post-optimization plain SVG, not the pre-optimization composer string or compressed delivery bytes. The headless DM-2636 E2E requests optimized SVGZ, gunzips the delivered artifact, and proves byte equality with debug/actual.svg while also validating three per-frame PNG/tree pairs and the shared HAR.",
            "markdown": "The bundle copies the final post-optimization plain SVG, not the pre-optimization composer string or compressed delivery bytes. The headless DM-2636 E2E requests optimized SVGZ, gunzips the delivered artifact, and proves byte equality with debug/actual.svg while also validating three per-frame PNG/tree pairs and the shared HAR."
          },
